{
  "bookId": "hero-211013",
  "id": "bond-29341",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "29341001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "群鸦的魔女，此世最优秀的奥术法师，孤高的流浪骑士诺伊尓小姐——这边请。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341002",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "为什么这些话你念出来就让我觉得很羞耻啊！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "这座高塔是……法师塔？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "是的，这是给你的新住处。魔女、法师、巫师、魔法少女之类的不都喜欢住在高塔里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341005",
          "sourceType": 5,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "说了，我和魔法少女根本不一样！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不喜欢吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我也没说不喜欢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "只有拥有足够的名望和地位的魔女，才会拥有自己的法师塔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29341010",
              "text": "你已经是了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29341010",
              "text": "毕竟你帮助了很多手办"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29341009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "顺带一提，边上的空地还有专供骑士使用的训练场。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "……谢谢啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我可没想到有一天，曾经的使魔乌鸦会送给自己……一个居所。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "29341014",
              "text": "现在你能想到了"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "29341014",
              "text": "看来这个世界也充满了奇遇"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "29341013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "嗳，你曾经问过我现在的愿望，是吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你想好了吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341016",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "魔女双手背在身后，微微弯腰，对你露出了危险的微笑。",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "我想要——眼前的灵魂，眼前的你。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "诺伊尔",
          "text": "魔女的恋情可是有着死亡也无法消去的重量。你有这样的觉悟吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "29341019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我的答案和当初一样，诺伊尔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
